OL,3,CTrump warns Fifa replacing Infantino
OL,4,Cwould be 'terrible mistake'
OL,6,FUS President Donald Trump has warned
OL,7,FFifa would be making a "terrible
OL,8,Fmistake" if they get rid of Gianni
OL,9,FInfantino as the head of world
OL,10,Ffootball's governing body.
OL,12,FInfantino has come under pressure
OL,13,Ffollowing his doomed plan to sell off
OL,14,Fstakes in the men's World Cup to
OL,15,Fprivate investors.
OL,17,FBut in a post on his Truth Social
OL,18,Fplatform early on Tuesday, Trump said
OL,19,Fremoving the Fifa president would be a
OL,20,Fcostly move.
OL,26,@oD@XOUpD@HO]
