OL,3,CTrump warns Fifa replacing Infantino
OL,4,Cwould be 'terrible mistake'
OL,6,FThe US president wrote: "Fifa would be
OL,7,Fmaking a terrible mistake if, for any
OL,8,Freason, they even considered replacing
OL,9,FPresident Gianni Infantino.
OL,11,F"He is fantastic, having just presided
OL,12,Fover the most successful World Cup, by
OL,13,Ffour times, ever presented. If he is
OL,14,Fgone, it will never be as successful
OL,15,For profitable again!"
OL,26,@nD@YOUsD@AOUwD@UO]
