OL,3,CTrump warns Fifa replacing Infantino
OL,4,Cwould be 'terrible mistake'
OL,6,FUEFA and two other confederations have
OL,7,Fheld initial talks about organising
OL,8,Fcompetitions themselves amid the
OL,9,Fbacklash against the embattled Fifa
OL,10,Fpresident, the Press Association
OL,11,Funderstands.
OL,13,FEurope's governing body, the Asian
OL,14,FFootball Confederation (AFC) and
OL,15,FCONCACAF, which oversees football in
OL,16,Fthe Caribbean, North and Central
OL,17,FAmerica, have accused Infantino of
OL,18,F"deception".
OL,26,@zD@AOUzD@KO]
