OL,3,CTrump warns Fifa replacing Infantino
OL,4,Cwould be 'terrible mistake'
OL,6,FWhile it is understood they want to
OL,7,Fgive him the chance to resign and
OL,8,Fleave his position with dignity
OL,9,Fwithout seeking re-election in March
OL,10,Fnext year, they want to insulate
OL,11,Fthemselves from the unfolding crisis.
OL,13,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,14,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,15,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,16,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,18,FUEFA has previously threatened a
OL,19,Fboycott of Fifa competitions.
