OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F314A1786969114
OL,3,CTrump warns Fifa replacing Infantino
OL,4,Cwould be 'terrible mistake'
OL,6,FInfantino apologised for his proposal
OL,7,Fto create Fifa Forward Enterprise
OL,8,F(FFE), a company to run the commercial
OL,9,Fand operational aspects of Fifa's
OL,10,Ftournaments, with an idea to sell off
OL,11,Faround 20 per cent to private
OL,12,Finvestors.
OL,14,FBut an open letter signed by the heads
OL,15,Fof UEFA, AFC and CONCACAF has urged
OL,16,FFifa to hold an independent review
OL,17,Finto Infantino's scheme, while not
OL,18,Fnaming the Swiss directly.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G5/6
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
