PN,31406
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F314A1786969114
OL,3,CTrump warns Fifa replacing Infantino
OL,4,Cwould be 'terrible mistake'
OL,6,F"Leadership in football is not a
OL,7,Fpossession," the letter said. "It is
OL,8,Fnot about holding ` or demanding `
OL,9,Fpower to be held. It is a duty of
OL,10,Fservice to the football family that
OL,11,Fentrusts it.
OL,13,F"When trust is broken through
OL,14,Fdeception, when an individual places
OL,15,Fhimself above the collective that
OL,16,Fentrusted him with authority, that
OL,17,Fduty has been abandoned."
OL,26,@nD@AOUoD@LO]oD@_OUuD@AOUyD@YO]
